# Trait Doctoring replaces the basic land type Forest with Swamp in Yavimaya's text until end of turn (CR 612.1), so
# "Each land is a Forest in addition to its other land types" says Swamp: Bot2's Island is a Swamp, not a Forest, and
# Yavimaya taps for {B} (CR 305.6). Yavimaya is still called Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth (CR 612.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth
Trait Doctoring
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Forest; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: Add {U})
Bot1.Hand.Trait Doctoring.Cast(Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Replace a basic land type)
Bot1.Modes(Forest)
Bot1.Modes(Swamp)
Bot1.Battlefield.Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {B}

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Island; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth.Subtypes = Swamp
